\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The CAT workspace, mid-conversation. Channels, agents and people are listed in the sidebar, the last grouped by discipline. Note that the agent is answering \emph  {for a particular reader}---``this is the part closest to your discipline'', ``that's the statistician's area''---because it was told who asked and what they work on. The line beneath the reply records which model answered and what it cost; the composer names the agents available to summon. Shown in the dark theme, and captured before \texttt  {\#general} and the theme control were added; the layout is otherwise current.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:interface}{{1}{3}{The CAT workspace, mid-conversation. Channels, agents and people are listed in the sidebar, the last grouped by discipline. Note that the agent is answering \emph {for a particular reader}---``this is the part closest to your discipline'', ``that's the statistician's area''---because it was told who asked and what they work on. The line beneath the reply records which model answered and what it cost; the composer names the agents available to summon. Shown in the dark theme, and captured before \texttt {\#general} and the theme control were added; the layout is otherwise current}{figure.1}{}}
